Let e be the eccentricity of hyperbola and length of conjugate axis be $2 h$. since, vertex $(a, 0)$ bisects the join of centre (0,0) and focus $(a e, 0)$
$\begin{array}{l}$a=$\frac{a e+0}{2} \Rightarrow$e=2 \\
b^{2}=a^{2}$\left($c^{2}-1\right)=3 a^{2}
\end{array}

$\therefore$ Required hyperbola is $\frac{x^{2}}{a^{2}}-\frac{y^{2}}{b^{2}}=1\Rightarrow \quad \frac{x^{2}}{a^{2}}-\frac{y^{2}}{3 a^{2}}=1 \Rightarrow 3 x^{2}-y^{2}=3 a^{2}$
